index aa11bb2..cc33dd4 100644
--- a/docs/tuning.md
+++ b/docs/tuning.md
@@ -40,6 +40,14 @@ Set `worker_threads` to the number of physical cores.

 ## Memory

+### Buffer pooling
+
+The rewriter keeps up to `buffer_pool_max` scratch buffers alive between
+requests. Each is `SCRATCH` (64 KiB) so the ceiling is roughly:
+
+    buffer_pool_max * 64KiB = 8 MiB
+
+Lower it on memory constrained nodes; raise it under bursty load.
+
 ### Allocator

 We link jemalloc on Linux.
